+/**
+ * An image in the home, as base64, for the Files view and the Markdown
+ * preview (see `./images`). Only a PNG, JPEG, GIF, WebP or SVG, by extension;
+ * anything else is refused. With `relativeTo`, `path` is a Markdown image's
